out the 1950s and 1960s. While the exact date of their marriage remains unclear, sources indicate that the couple exchanged vows in the early 1960s, during the height of their careers. The union was reportedly a long and happy one, with the couple supporting each other through the ups and downs of their professional lives. \"I had the pleasure of working with both Tadao-san and Hanayo-san on separate projects, and I can attest to the love and respect they had for each other,\" said Japanese actress, Yumi Shirakawa. \"They were a true power couple, and their marriage is a testament to the enduring power of love.\" Data from the Japanese Ministry of Health, Labour and Welfare confirms that Takashima and Sumi were indeed married, with records showing that they registered their union in 1963.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Hanayo Sumi", "Evelyn Herbert Webb"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Hanayo Sumi", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Evelyn Herbert Webb", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "person"}

